    "title": "HFG Appoints Bryant, West To Leadership Roles - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shelby Team ,\n1 days ago Houchens Food Group Inc. has announced two leadership appointments – Misty Bryant to director of retail operations and Boyd West as senior director of fresh merchandising. Bryant, who joined Houchens Food Group in 2007 as a merchandising assistant, has held a series of progressively senior roles over nearly two decades with the company, including category manager and, most recently, director of merchandising support. Her expertise spans merchandising, pricing, inventory management and store operations. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
